{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of <i>Kinpath</i>, where a lineage of brave little frogs embarks on a journey of growth, exploration, and legacy. \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039970/extras/c8e233aa8a140a0fcbce6b8781a3bb07.avif?t=1764239025\" width=600 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chart a course for your frog\u2019s adventure and shape their destiny. As they travel through diverse locations, your little hero will grow stronger, gain new skills, and uncover treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will they delve into magic, embrace the swiftness of a rogue, or stand firm as a resilient fighter? The journey is yours to plan!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039970/extras/2ea00ee481e7885ca7f0909b6f0d9d56.poster.avif?t=1764239025\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039970/extras/2ea00ee481e7885ca7f0909b6f0d9d56.webm?t=1764239025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039970/extras/2ea00ee481e7885ca7f0909b6f0d9d56.mp4?t=1764239025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039970/extras/0a060787874428b97b05d4991d46596d.avif?t=1764239025\" width=600 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every adventure has new enemies to face. Watch your frog tackle these challenges with the skills and items they\u2019ve gathered along the way. Their success depends on the choices you 